    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 984,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "关于",
        "连贯的一则手记。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-55008bbb8201",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 984,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "你可能刚认出一个旧想法，就想改进它的表达：句子太长，某个约束已经不再适用",
        "，粗略的问题值得写得更清楚。让档案有用，就要允许这样的工作，而不是把每个",
        "保存下来的字都视为不可触碰。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-60638d5b24f6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1111,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "与此同时，过去不应该被悄悄改写。在比较思考如何变化时，今天润色过的版本不",
        "能冒充上个月真正写下的内容。一份工作档案，必须同时满足这两种需要。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dca98617c2a7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1206,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 区分原始来源和可编辑的工作版本。来源提供回到当时事实的路径，工作版本",
        "则让你把材料整理成现在可读、可用的样子。它们无需冒充彼此。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8f1e28d061a9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1321,
      "x2": 367,
      "y2": 1321,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1363,
      "width": 701,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 51,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1539,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "可选的 AI 辅助增加的是一个层次，而不是另一个主人。更清晰的呈现可能有帮助",
        "，但它必须区别于来源材料和人工修改。自动更新不应该悄悄丢掉你已经完成的工",
        "作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3d84d3d596a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1666,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "到了复用的时候，哪个版本有用，取决于具体任务。你可能需要原始引文、当前的",
        "工作总结，或几段选中的材料。预览内容是选择的一部分，而不是把它从档案取出",
        "的障碍。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b1ed7845f895",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1793,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "连贯，不意味着永远不改变主意。它意味着：当时说过的话、此刻的想法、以及下",
        "一步的选择之间，存在一条可以看懂的联系。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-99fc79b62de8",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-zh-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1914,
      "width": 740,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
